## Commandes de publication

```bash
# 1. Sauvegarder les trois fichiers
cd ~/nexus-sovereign-terminal
nano .gitignore    # coller le contenu, Ctrl+O, Entrée, Ctrl+X
nano README.md     # coller, sauver
nano LICENSE       # coller, sauver

# 2. Vérifier
ls -la .gitignore README.md LICENSE

# 3. Committer
git add .gitignore README.md LICENSE
git commit -m "docs: sovereign publication — gitignore, readme, license (39% commercial)"

# 4. Pousser
git push origin main
ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER
DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.
